    <string name="feedback_email">calestinfisalia@gmail.com</string>
    <string name="drawer_privacy">Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="drawer_terms">Terms of Service</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_content">1. Data collection: Fisalia Files runs locally and does not collect, sell, or transfer your personal files to third-party servers.\n\n2. Storage access: The storage permission (MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE) is used only to browse, manage, copy, and play media files on your device.\n\n3. Network connections: Credentials for SMB, FTP, SFTP, and WebDAV servers are stored locally on your device.</string>
    <string name="terms_of_service_content">1. Use of the app: You may use Fisalia Files for personal and professional file management.\n\n2. Security: You are responsible for your Safe Folder PIN and any network server credentials you save.\n\n3. No warranty: This software is provided as is and may be updated or improved periodically.</string>

